# Web API wiring

When adding or finishing a backend module:

1. Add payload types in `apps/web/src/api/types.ts`
2. Add hooks in `apps/web/src/api/queries.ts` (`apiFetch` / `apiPost` → `http://localhost:4000`)
3. Replace `PhaseSkeleton` on the matching page with real panels/tables
4. Match existing patterns: `PageHeader`, `Panel`, `StatusPill`, `Table`, `Button`

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — phase API done, page still skeleton
<PhaseSkeleton phase={6} title="Strategies" ... />

// ✅ GOOD — page consumes /api/strategies*
const { data } = useStrategies();
```

Invalidate related query keys after mutations (`evaluate`, `run`, `reconcile`).
